msgid "Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your quantum machine learning skills and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr "Ambil peperiksaan 20 soalan di laman IBM Training untuk menguji kemahiran pembelajaran mesin kuantum anda dan terima lencana melalui Credly."

