msgstr "<LaunchExamButton href=\"https://www.ibm.com/training/course/quantum-machine-learning-badge-quiz-DL46107G\" />\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be viewed [here](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/).\n"
msgstr "NOTIS: IBM memanfaatkan perkhidmatan Credly, pemproses data pihak ketiga yang dibenarkan oleh IBM dan berlokasi di Amerika Syarikat, untuk membantu dalam pentadbiran program IBM Digital Badge. Bagi mengeluarkan IBM Digital Badge kepada anda, maklumat peribadi anda (nama, alamat e-mel, dan lencana yang diperoleh) akan dikongsi dengan Credly. Anda akan menerima pemberitahuan e-mel daripada Credly dengan arahan untuk menuntut lencana. Maklumat peribadi anda digunakan untuk mengeluarkan lencana anda dan untuk tujuan pelaporan program dan operasi. IBM mungkin berkongsi maklumat peribadi yang dikumpul dengan anak syarikat IBM dan pihak ketiga secara global. Ia akan dikendalikan dengan cara yang konsisten dengan amalan privasi IBM. Pernyataan Privasi IBM boleh dilihat [di sini.](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/)\n"
